<article class="task" id="install-tool"><h1>Installing the tool</h1><p class="shortdesc">Install and verify the command-line tool.</p><section class="prereq"><h2>Before you begin</h2><p>You need <code>dotnet</code> 8 or later.</p></section><ol class="steps"><li class="step" data-required="yes"><span class="cmd">Run <code>dotnet tool install xtransform</code>.</span><div class="info"><p>This downloads the tool.</p></div></li><li class="step"><span class="cmd">Open <b class="ui">a terminal</b>.</span></li><li class="step" data-required="yes"><span class="cmd">Type <code>xtransform --version</code>.</span></li></ol><section class="result"><h2>Result</h2><p>The version number is printed.</p></section></article>